{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：奇鋐2Q26毛利率超预期，下半年ASIC与GPU项目驱动</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>在8月13日发布的亚太科技产业观察报告，核心判断并不复杂：奇鋐（Asia Vital Components）<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>毛利率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>只是开始，下半年随着英伟达VR200冷板和ASIC液冷项目放量，毛利率还有继续抬升的空间。报告将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>每股盈余预测各上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>，并首次给出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>预测。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>数字。营收<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">491亿</span>新台币，与市场预期基本持平，但毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">32.6%</span>比彭博一致预期高了156个基点，营业利润率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">27.4%</span>也比预期高出228个基点。服务器产品占比达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">66%</span>，产品结构<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>和产线效率提升是主要推动力。单季每股盈余24.4新台币，比一致预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOW6w0pYHTFSJvic0GXApnpNjjTfQeCUsicn5MtzcSelMlYnVNBZTIjpZfrXDYmjZFJhzwZwdbnNpCBUYCdnBGQuscHYnIHntic968/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 七月营收显示增长动能正在重新<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告披露的七月营收<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">186亿</span>新台币，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">57%</span>。这个数字的重要性在于，它发生在英伟达GB300出货量还在爬坡的阶段，而VR200冷板量产要到八月才启动。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>据此推算<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>营收<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">577亿</span>新台币，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>，同比增长48%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把时间线拆开看，增长节奏相当清晰。八月和九月有VR200冷板量产支撑，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>又有AWS Trainium 3和谷歌TPU v8的液冷版本开始爬坡。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>营收环比再增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>。两个季度的增长引擎不同，但都指向同一个方向：液冷收入占比在持续上升。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看七月营收这个节点，它比季度平均数据更能反映当下的出货强度。简单说，GB300还在爬坡时营收已经同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">57%</span>，等VR200冷板八月量产后，环比动能大概率更强；我更关注的是ASIC液冷项目在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>能否按计划放量，这决定了明年<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>营收能否延续高增长。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXXEGTaH5t17xRKBGf451kiaLYqN7PUm0ebITibCCWR7aZgUNSB7TRqQSD0ogMqOTCN2kNTqvaTQiam2MY699ia87ZSsC5P0wFuicXk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 毛利率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>是市场<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">预期差</span>最大的地方</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告最核心的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">预期差</span>在毛利率。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">34%</span>、四季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">35%</span>，而彭博一致预期仍停留在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">31%</span>到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">32%</span>之间。差距来自两个判断：一是液冷收入占比持续提升，液冷产品毛利率显著高于传统气冷；二是良率改善带来的生产端红利。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这个判断有历史数据支撑。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">32.6%</span>，比去年同期高出816个基点，比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>高出280个基点。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>认为，随着液冷占比继续上升，这个<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>趋势在下半年只会更强，而不是节奏变化。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>全年毛利率预测为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">33.1%</span>，2027年进一步升至35.3%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUgBO0A5wlA0DuF7dgiaIRibXbRrrg5qxKJ6Icgyo2nZgrg5JicTYmxp9LJD1u3d6fo9WpGPnicP4ODD5ChW9La4gHt2fzgJkiaAXGA/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 液冷之外，CPO和LPU可能成为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>后的新增量</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告提到一个容易被忽略的信息：管理层在读者会议上表示，公司未来可能成为CPO（光收发模块）、LPU/LPX等新方案的液冷主要供应商。这些项目预计从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>开始贡献增量收入。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把这件事拆开看，奇鋐的定位正在从单纯的散热组件供应商，向AI服务器整体热管理方案商转变。液冷TAM的增长不仅来自英伟达GPU系统，还来自ASIC液冷渗透率提升，以及GPU tray/rack系统设计越来越复杂带来的单机价值量增加。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXcZ8efEl4ORWonD1QWOFMNfISyEBtMRKnz8skqVqeywl6eAftSBGCuJcnFzpur16bS4M9BnFSsotGlXN3eOT8w1FHBCXwSP2c/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 47-JPM-Asia Vital Components-3017.TW--More GM upside into 2H26- with ASIC and GPU project ramp- OW-260813</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
